# Roundtable

Roundtable is a community discussion website inspired by modern social platforms, built with Next.js and PostgreSQL.

## Features
- User signup and login
- Community creation
- Discussion posts
- Comments
- Notifications
- Search and browsing

## Tech Stack
- Next.js
- Prisma
- PostgreSQL
- Tailwind CSS

## Local Development
```bash
npm install
npm run dev
